(text "All CM4 ground contacts connect to the continuous secondary-side ground plane.\nUnused camera, display, HDMI, TV and reserved contacts have explicit no-connect markers.\nKeep unconnected pads physically isolated; do not ground reserved signal contacts." (at 15.24 248.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7e553a0d-e2f6-5ed3-a8aa-8777fab25149"))
